## AI / LLM editing checklist

1. Respect dependency direction — never invert the layer graph; **packages never import apps**.
2. Use `@repo/<pkg>/all` entrypoints only; never import internals.
3. After editing `@repo/core` schemas, update all consumers.
4. After editing `schema.prisma`: run `db-gen` (and `db-push` if syncing dev DB) before relying on types/client.
5. New **custom** DB scripts: add file under `src/migrations/scripts/` and register in **`src/migrations/run.ts`** in order.
6. **Run `lint` + `check-types` in every touched package. Fix all errors. Repeat until clean. This is mandatory.**
7. Use **Context7 MCP** when writing code against any library API to get current docs.
8. Use **Firecrawl skill** for any web fetch, search, or scraping task.
9. Use **`mcp-mermaid`** for any task that requires **drawing, creating, or editing** a **visual diagram** (follow **Mermaid diagram MCP** above).
